00:00:00,007 --> 00:00:02,637
KAMI TRANSLATION

2
00:00:00,007 --> 00:00:02,637
TL & TS: AnimeAkshay

3
00:00:00,007 --> 00:00:02,637
TLC & QC: Livid

4
00:00:00,007 --> 00:00:02,637
KFX & Timing: Blaze077

5
00:00:00,047 --> 00:00:04,997


6
00:00:03,027 --> 00:00:05,517
Amazing, a real Conqueror.

7
00:00:05,547 --> 00:00:08,487
Is that lightning like a proof of that spirit!?

8
00:00:08,547 --> 00:00:10,947
So the legend about Dungeon was really true.

9
00:00:20,867 --> 00:00:21,847
Harun-dono!

10
00:00:22,447 --> 00:00:26,287
Amazing... It's like an amphitheatre here.

11
00:00:26,367 --> 00:00:28,147
Yes, all thanks to you.

12
00:00:29,977 --> 00:00:33,887
Certainly, this is something that only a conqueror like yourself could do.

13
00:00:34,907 --> 00:00:36,487
Good thing you realized that.

14
00:00:37,047 --> 00:00:37,987
Not at all,

15
00:00:38,777 --> 00:00:40,717
it was really all thanks to you.

16
00:00:40,947 --> 00:00:45,227
It's because you said that my story was more interesting than those poets you mentioned.

17
00:00:45,687 --> 00:00:47,807
Also that it was a dream tale, that you admire

18
00:00:48,647 --> 00:00:49,847
That's when I realized.

19
00:00:50,287 --> 00:00:54,407
That these tales are something that could draw anyone in and mesmerize them.

20
00:00:54,717 --> 00:00:57,717
Just like I was once.

21
00:00:58,517 --> 00:00:59,407
But...

22
00:00:59,607 --> 00:01:02,347
...It's not even close to 1000 coins yet...

23
00:01:03,027 --> 00:01:08,027


24
00:01:03,147 --> 00:01:04,867
...plus today is the promised day.

25
00:01:06,727 --> 00:01:07,777
That's why I ask,

26
00:01:08,067 --> 00:01:09,887
that you please wait for little while.

27
00:01:10,347 --> 00:01:12,607
I'll definitely complete your criteria.

28
00:01:13,227 --> 00:01:14,487
As I don't plan on giving up.

29
00:01:22,087 --> 00:01:24,427
This is a fee for listening to your play.

30
00:01:24,857 --> 00:01:26,857
Take it, Sinbad!

31
00:01:27,287 --> 00:01:28,857
In order to realize your dream...

32
00:01:29,367 --> 00:01:32,857
I'll assist, as your friend!

33
00:01:33,227 --> 00:01:34,977
But the promise—

34
00:01:35,407 --> 00:01:38,827
There are a ton of things you need to do,

35
00:01:39,187 --> 00:01:42,447
you don't have time to be stranded here, right?

36
00:01:44,287 --> 00:01:45,117
Harun-dono...

37
00:01:45,117 --> 00:01:47,027
I mean, Sensei!

38
00:01:47,427 --> 00:01:48,747
Just who are you...

39
00:01:48,947 --> 00:01:50,947
Oh, so you were here!

40
00:01:51,487 --> 00:01:53,947
It'd be troublesome if you leave like that.

41
00:01:56,577 --> 00:02:00,007
This person here is Balbadd's 22nd King himself,

42
00:02:00,287 --> 00:02:02,807
Our King, Rashid!

43
00:02:10,947 --> 00:02:14,207
Dammit, I should've stayed in Reim after all.

44
00:02:16,067 --> 00:02:19,117
Ja'fur, if you have enough energy to chatter,

45
00:02:19,117 --> 00:02:20,857
then use that in moving your hands.

46
00:02:21,087 --> 00:02:23,377
Just look at this pile of homework.

47
00:02:24,627 --> 00:02:28,287
I am not here with you lot to do something like this.

48
00:02:28,567 --> 00:02:29,577
I am done with this shit.

49
00:02:29,577 --> 00:02:31,627
I'll swim my way to the Reim this instant.

50
00:02:31,777 --> 00:02:33,087
Don't be hasty, Ja'far!

51
00:02:33,207 --> 00:02:34,977
Yeah, calm down for a second!

52
00:02:35,177 --> 00:02:36,027
Leave me!

53
00:02:36,027 --> 00:02:37,767
Let me go...

54
00:02:37,807 --> 00:02:38,887
Ja'far,

55
00:02:39,887 --> 00:02:41,087
come here!

56
00:02:42,827 --> 00:02:44,147
I know,

57
00:02:44,187 --> 00:02:49,807
how difficult and painful is studying for you.

58
00:02:50,867 --> 00:02:53,607
For you who were born and raised in the assassination organization,

59
00:02:53,947 --> 00:02:55,917
it's something that you haven't experience after all.

60
00:03:00,087 --> 00:03:04,117
You're not with us to to study—

61
00:03:05,947 --> 00:03:08,207
But are here because of your master.

62
00:03:09,517 --> 00:03:10,917
That's what you mean, right!?

63
00:03:11,947 --> 00:03:14,487
But haven't you already made up your mind!?

64
00:03:15,257 --> 00:03:17,117
That you'll change your way of living.

65
00:03:18,917 --> 00:03:24,207
Even I fear for his safety and want to stay with him there in Reim.

66
00:03:25,027 --> 00:03:29,007
But that's more the reason, you should work hard here.

67
00:03:30,147 --> 00:03:34,207
So that you could repay your master who showed you a new path.

68
00:03:35,227 --> 00:03:37,257
Isn't that right, Ja'far!?

69
00:03:41,427 --> 00:03:43,287
W—What happened!?

70
00:03:44,027 --> 00:03:48,857
Ja'far, there's something that I haven't told you yet...

71
00:03:50,117 --> 00:03:53,627
To tell you the truth... a...

72
00:03:54,147 --> 00:03:56,627
...a child is about to be born soon.

73
00:03:57,177 --> 00:03:58,867
EEEEHHHH!!!?

74
00:03:59,117 --> 00:04:02,317
Woman in Imuchakk tribe who've been living in severe environment for ages,

75
00:04:02,347 --> 00:04:05,827
deliver a child in just few months after their pregnancy.

76
00:04:06,347 --> 00:04:07,707
This is also a form of studying,

77
00:04:07,987 --> 00:04:10,967
I'll lead  you well so learn midwifery with me.

78
00:04:12,627 --> 00:04:15,027
Hold him well in your arms,

79
00:04:15,807 --> 00:04:17,407
your younger brother, I mean

80
00:04:22,237 --> 00:04:27,067
It won't end until my heartbeat stops

