8235
00:05:44,097 --> 00:05:45,117
iu

8236
00:05:51,767 --> 00:05:54,027
Household Vessel

8237
00:05:57,977 --> 00:05:58,827
Thank you very much,

8238
00:05:58,827 --> 00:06:00,287
Sensei!

8239
00:06:00,467 --> 00:06:02,467
Thanks to you, I was able to register to the association without any troubles.

8240
00:06:03,147 --> 00:06:06,517
Now even I can start my business here in Naporlia.

8241
00:06:07,047 --> 00:06:10,007
I wonder when the new stock from Imuchakk will arrive.

8242
00:06:10,407 --> 00:06:11,647
Sinbad...

8243
00:06:11,647 --> 00:06:13,647
...lets have you do a theatre performance.

8244
00:06:14,427 --> 00:06:15,367
Say what!?

8245
00:06:15,887 --> 00:06:17,407
It's not that I dislike the idea but,,

8246
00:06:17,887 --> 00:06:22,027
Acting was something that I started as a means to earn the money for the registration.

8247
00:06:22,427 --> 00:06:24,227
But I doubt that I need it anymore...

8248
00:06:24,687 --> 00:06:27,377
You might be mature than your age,

8249
00:06:27,547 --> 00:06:30,227
But it looks like you still have a long way to go as a trader.

8250
00:06:31,007 --> 00:06:32,607
Even if you register your corporation,

8251
00:06:32,747 --> 00:06:34,577
you don't have a place to sell anything, right?

8252
00:06:35,657 --> 00:06:38,407
Also you need a warehouse to store your goods,

8253
00:06:38,547 --> 00:06:40,777
and wagons for the transport as well.

8254
00:06:40,777 --> 00:06:43,607
You may also require a means to advertise your store.

8255
00:06:44,657 --> 00:06:47,207
Rather, this is where it gets hard.

8256
00:06:47,687 --> 00:06:48,917
I see...

8257
00:06:49,427 --> 00:06:51,647
You might know it already, but here in Reim,

8258
00:06:51,847 --> 00:06:55,827
as part of policy, several kinds of 
entertainments are offered to the citizens.

8259
00:06:56,547 --> 00:06:58,347
Gladiator grounds of the Colosseum,

8260
00:06:58,517 --> 00:06:59,467
Gambling house,

8261
00:06:59,707 --> 00:07:00,787
Bathing house,

8262
00:07:00,917 --> 00:07:02,547
and in the end, theatres.

8263
00:07:03,087 --> 00:07:07,487
Among these, fighting and acting are something which pick the interest of too many citizens.

8264
00:07:07,887 --> 00:07:09,827
Fighting and acting...

8265
00:07:10,377 --> 00:07:12,657
But, I'd suggest you to not consider gladiator even an option.

8266
00:07:13,407 --> 00:07:14,907
That's a severe exhibition of fellow humans...

8267
00:07:15,287 --> 00:07:19,587
and sometimes even monsters fighting with each other.

8268
00:07:20,917 --> 00:07:24,747
Your body is the only asset  you have right now.

8269
00:07:25,487 --> 00:07:27,827
There is no particular reason for you to risk that and fight.

8270
00:07:28,407 --> 00:07:29,287
Yes...

8271
00:07:30,067 --> 00:07:34,327
The tale that you narrated was really something worth the applause.

8272
00:07:35,167 --> 00:07:38,967
If you perform that in theatres you'll become the talk among the masses for sure.

8273
00:07:39,787 --> 00:07:43,887
I think this is the best way to lead your corporation to success.

8274
00:07:44,467 --> 00:07:45,447
What do you think!?

8275
00:07:48,207 --> 00:07:49,127
I'll do it!

8276
00:07:50,107 --> 00:07:52,087
With that said, I'll prepare at once.

8277
00:07:55,407 --> 00:07:57,807
Thank you again, Sensei!

8278
00:08:05,167 --> 00:08:07,987
My Lord, carriage is stationed over there.

8279
00:08:08,647 --> 00:08:11,607
Weren't you supposed to use that to reach the meeting at Imperial Court!?

8280
00:08:12,347 --> 00:08:16,047
Leave it there, with this distance we'll reach faster while walking.

8281
00:08:16,547 --> 00:08:17,907
Is that so...

8282
00:08:22,407 --> 00:08:25,647
My Lord, looks like you're having fun.

8283
00:08:28,927 --> 00:08:30,127
Yeah, probably I am.

8284
00:08:36,447 --> 00:08:39,087
See, he finally smiled! There!

8285
00:08:41,667 --> 00:08:44,167
Here, I finished my assignment.

8286
00:08:44,547 --> 00:08:46,767
What, already!?

8287
00:08:51,047 --> 00:08:54,887
And a perfect score as well, you did well.

8288
00:08:55,387 --> 00:08:56,887
Amazing, Ja'far!

8289
00:08:57,967 --> 00:09:00,927
Then, I'll go and help Vittel and others.

8290
00:09:02,687 --> 00:09:03,847
Ja'far!

8291
00:09:08,487 --> 00:09:13,727
We'll head now to prepare the meal so take care of Kikiriku-kun till then.

8292
00:09:14,027 --> 00:09:17,887
Cute ain't he!? 
Papa will come back from his job soon,

8293
00:09:18,207 --> 00:09:20,547
so hang out with your big-brother till then.

8294
00:09:26,607 --> 00:09:28,027
You're heavy!

8295
00:09:35,047 --> 00:09:39,807
It's written "Rumored Dungeon Conqueror" here, I wonder if that's true!?

8296
00:09:39,987 --> 00:09:42,527
It seems they came up with this programme in a hurry as well.

8297
00:09:43,027 --> 00:09:44,767
This might be total bogus, just saying.

8298
00:09:45,727 --> 00:09:49,767
Well who cares, if it's another trivial event, then we could just leave in the mid—

8299
00:09:58,007 --> 00:09:59,127
I welcome you all,

8300
00:09:59,407 --> 00:10:02,827
to the heart throbbing world of adventures!

8301
00:10:04,967 --> 00:10:07,607
A person over there!?

8302
00:10:23,207 --> 00:10:24,247
Amazing...

8303
00:10:24,347 --> 00:10:26,327
I've never seen something like this...

8304
00:10:26,367 --> 00:10:28,147
They're glittering like stars!

8305
00:10:29,247 --> 00:10:30,447
Ho...

8306
00:10:30,687 --> 00:10:32,507
What'll be narrated at this place tonight are,

8307
00:10:32,687 --> 00:10:36,007
the tales of adventure of a child called Sinbad.

8308
00:10:36,607 --> 00:10:38,767
I hope you enjoy this thrilling ride,

8309
00:10:39,167 --> 00:10:41,207
with me till the end.

8310
00:10:43,727 --> 00:10:46,187
The power of Djinn that people saw for the first time.

8311
00:10:46,187 --> 00:10:48,387
With the tales of the Dungeon.

8312
00:10:49,407 --> 00:10:53,567
overwhelmed them and made them express it like this...

8313
00:10:53,887 --> 00:10:58,567
"All the performances that we have seen or the choirs where hundreds sing together,

8314
00:10:58,567 --> 00:11:01,607
are nothing compared to this performance."

8315
00:11:02,687 --> 00:11:06,687
Soon it's popularity reached even the remote regions of Reim,

8316
00:11:07,127 --> 00:11:12,807
Due to which the people who couldn't watch it on the first day, lined up in front of the theatre.

8317
00:11:37,447 --> 00:11:38,967
And soon,

8318
00:11:39,707 --> 00:11:43,367
there was hardly anyone in the city who didn't knew him.

8319
00:11:48,827 --> 00:11:50,427
Looks like it was another big hit!?

8320
00:11:50,647 --> 00:11:55,127
Yes, yet again all thanks to you who advised me to do the theatre.

8321
00:11:56,487 --> 00:12:02,667
But, I still feel bad for the people who came all the way to watch and yet couldn't enter.

8322
00:12:03,647 --> 00:12:05,727
I somehow want to resolve the issue...

8323
00:12:07,527 --> 00:12:10,527
Greedy to the utmost aren't we!?

8324
00:12:10,987 --> 00:12:12,227
Is that so!?

8325
00:12:27,407 --> 00:12:28,487
That is...

8326
00:12:28,987 --> 00:12:30,967
Is this your first time looking at it!?

8327
00:12:31,467 --> 00:12:33,367
That is the Colosseum.

8328
00:12:32,757 --> 00:12:39,177
Visit us at
https://kamitranslation.wordpress.com/

8329
00:12:40,167 --> 00:12:43,367
Now, let's unload the things, shall we!?

8330
00:12:43,607 --> 00:12:45,247
Are you perhaps Hinahoho-sama!?

8331
00:12:46,327 --> 00:12:47,927
Yes, that'd would me.

8332
00:12:48,907 --> 00:12:51,327
I am an envoy of Sinbad-sama.

8333
00:12:51,567 --> 00:12:52,907
Sinbad's!?

8334
00:12:53,527 --> 00:12:55,107
I've come to receive you on the carriage.

8335
00:12:56,887 --> 00:12:59,807
Then, Rurumu and me will take care of the cargo,

8336
00:12:59,807 --> 00:13:00,887
you guys can go ahead.

8337
00:13:01,727 --> 00:13:03,527
Kikiriku-kun come with me.

8338
00:13:06,047 --> 00:13:06,667
Oh my~

8339
00:13:06,747 --> 00:13:09,027
He sure got attached to Ja'far.

8340
00:13:09,967 --> 00:13:12,607
It's fine, I'll take you along with me.

8341
00:13:14,287 --> 00:13:15,887
In that case, please take care of him.

8342
00:13:16,067 --> 00:13:16,747
Yes!

8343
00:13:18,047 --> 00:13:20,487
I'll come for both of you afterwards.

8344
00:13:32,287 --> 00:13:33,567
This is...!?

8345
00:13:33,807 --> 00:13:35,287
Sailing across the stormy seas...

8346
00:13:35,447 --> 00:13:37,927
Sinbad who finally reached Imuchakk,

8347
00:13:38,247 --> 00:13:40,487
together with the Chief's son, Hinahoho

8348
00:13:40,867 --> 00:13:43,927
entered the depths of the labyrinth of Valefor.

8349
00:13:44,547 --> 00:13:45,927
Sinbad!?

8350
00:13:46,187 --> 00:13:48,167
Just what is he doing in a place like this!?

8351
00:13:49,307 --> 00:13:52,127
With a mysterious assassination organization,

8352
00:13:52,127 --> 00:13:54,367
secretly following both of their trails.

8353
00:13:54,687 --> 00:13:55,947
Just what happened here!?

8354
00:13:56,287 --> 00:14:00,407
Performances that Sinbad-sama started in order to raise funds,

8355
00:14:00,627 --> 00:14:02,767
couldn't fit at all in any theatre.

8356
00:14:03,227 --> 00:14:04,887
and finally led to the first ever performance,

8357
00:14:04,887 --> 00:14:07,727
in the history of Colosseum.

8358
00:14:10,407 --> 00:14:12,887
Anyone would be surprised if shown something like this.

8359
00:14:13,727 --> 00:14:14,887
Kikiriku-kun!?

8360
00:14:16,967 --> 00:14:19,607
Geez, that mischievous kid...

8361
00:14:23,467 --> 00:14:26,087
I doubt that he will come all the way down here...

8362
00:14:29,007 --> 00:14:31,087
Making me worry like that...

8363
00:14:56,967 --> 00:14:58,287
He is...

8364
00:14:59,327 --> 00:15:01,007
...one of the monster of this Colosseum.

8365
00:15:01,827 --> 00:15:03,627
This is Dark Magic...

8366
00:15:04,367 --> 00:15:08,487
To think it could turn people into a demon with black rukh...

8367
00:15:08,487 --> 00:15:10,927
<i>The demon will be born if this continues,</i>

8368
00:15:10,927 --> 00:15:13,927
<i>blow it away with Baal's power before that happens.</i>

8369
00:15:15,927 --> 00:15:17,407
<i>Sinbad!?</i>

8370
00:15:21,807 --> 00:15:23,087
<i>Wh—What are you...!?</i>

8371
00:15:24,607 --> 00:15:26,987
<i>I'll save my comrades at all cost.</i>

8372
00:15:31,587 --> 00:15:33,407
<i>I have to save him.</i>

8373
00:15:51,847 --> 00:15:53,427
In that case,

8374
00:15:55,207 --> 00:15:56,987
<i>I'll keep him busy until then.</i>

8375
00:16:07,847 --> 00:16:09,687
Sham Lash Style: Assassination Technique...

8376
00:16:09,807 --> 00:16:10,677
Binding Technique!

8377
00:16:11,827 --> 00:16:13,327
I'll finish it with this!

8378
00:16:19,587 --> 00:16:21,247
<i>Damn, I missed his vitals...</i>

8379
00:16:28,207 --> 00:16:30,967
<i>To be taken out by a meatball like him...</i>

8380
00:16:31,367 --> 00:16:33,627
<i>Even though killing was my only worth point...</i>

8381
00:16:33,807 --> 00:16:36,407
<i>There's no meaning of my life like this...!</i>

8382
00:16:37,047 --> 00:16:38,407
<i>So this is...</i>

8383
00:16:38,987 --> 00:16:40,527
<i>...the real you.</i>

8384
00:16:41,907 --> 00:16:44,367
<i>So that's how you've lived your life,</i>

8385
00:16:44,647 --> 00:16:47,847
<i>while deceiving and contradicting yourself!?</i>

8386
00:16:48,427 --> 00:16:51,167
<i>Shut up!
Just what can you understand!?</i>

8387
00:16:52,827 --> 00:16:55,427
<i>You're right!
I can't understand it.</i>

8388
00:16:56,367 --> 00:16:57,027
<i>But,</i>

8389
00:17:00,127 --> 00:17:01,827
<i>If you have no place to go,</i>

8390
00:17:01,927 --> 00:17:03,407
<i>then I can give you one.</i>

8391
00:17:03,967 --> 00:17:06,567
<i>I'll become your reason to live.</i>

8392
00:17:06,987 --> 00:17:09,127
<i>So stop deceiving yourself already.</i>

8393
00:17:09,847 --> 00:17:11,367
<i>I mean,</i>

8394
00:17:13,127 --> 00:17:15,007
<i>you've already crossed your path with me.</i>

8395
00:17:16,347 --> 00:17:17,467
<i>That's not it.</i>

8396
00:17:18,047 --> 00:17:19,247
<i>That's not it...</i>

8397
00:17:19,607 --> 00:17:21,287
<i>I am not that guy from before.</i>

8398
00:17:22,007 --> 00:17:24,827
<i>Everyone... and that person....</i>

8399
00:17:25,167 --> 00:17:28,767
<i>Guided someone like me who has just killing in his mind.</i>

8400
00:17:29,227 --> 00:17:30,607
<i>My reason to live...</i>

8401
00:17:31,447 --> 00:17:32,647
<i>That is...</i>

8402
00:17:33,407 --> 00:17:36,487
Can you hear me!?
I'll not let my comrade die.

8403
00:17:37,087 --> 00:17:38,127
That's why,

8404
00:17:38,127 --> 00:17:39,777
<i>I won't forgive if you die!</i>

8405
00:17:41,287 --> 00:17:43,287
<i>What I must do right now</i>

8406
00:17:43,327 --> 00:17:45,047
<i>is protect my comrade.</i>

8407
00:17:46,127 --> 00:17:48,047
<i>And save Kikiriku!</i>

8408
00:17:52,007 --> 00:17:53,727
<i>I ask for thy power,</i>

8409
00:17:53,847 --> 00:17:55,727
<i>my household!</i>

8410
00:17:55,727 --> 00:17:59,447
<i>O' household of thunder, 
born from the Djinn of Lightning, Baal!</i>

8411
00:18:07,367 --> 00:18:08,087
No...

8412
00:18:10,087 --> 00:18:11,187
<i>...not yet!</i>

8413
00:18:15,287 --> 00:18:17,247
<i>Come, Ja'far!</i>

8414
00:18:17,567 --> 00:18:20,187
Household Vessel: Bararaq Sei.

8415
00:18:26,367 --> 00:18:28,927
You're fine now...

8416
00:18:35,927 --> 00:18:38,447
Are you alright, Ja'far!?

8417
00:18:41,647 --> 00:18:43,687
Huh!? Sin!?

8418
00:18:45,207 --> 00:18:46,487
Where is Kikiriku!?

8419
00:18:47,807 --> 00:18:49,607
If it's the kid, don't worry about him.

8420
00:18:49,887 --> 00:18:51,847
I left him with Vittel and Mahad.

8421
00:18:52,207 --> 00:18:53,407
He was alright.

8422
00:18:53,807 --> 00:18:54,607
I see...

8423
00:18:55,227 --> 00:18:57,007
Thank god that it got concluded without any severe injuries...

8424
00:18:57,947 --> 00:19:02,167
If I remember correctly, while fighting the monster... 
lightning came out of this...

8425
00:19:02,367 --> 00:19:03,887
Lightning...!?

8426
00:19:05,847 --> 00:19:08,127
It's the same radiation like my sword.

8427
00:19:09,047 --> 00:19:12,047
I wonder if Baal, gave his power to your weapon!?

8428
00:19:13,867 --> 00:19:16,007
If I am the first Conqueror,

8429
00:19:16,007 --> 00:19:18,647
then that makes you the first warrior of the Djinn!

8430
00:19:20,447 --> 00:19:21,187
Yes.

8431
00:19:26,087 --> 00:19:27,247
Ja'far...

8432
00:19:27,567 --> 00:19:31,007
Looks like you saved Kikiriku while putting yourself into danger!?

8433
00:19:31,447 --> 00:19:33,367
It's not something that big of a deal.

8434
00:19:33,807 --> 00:19:34,987
Thank you...

8435
00:19:35,407 --> 00:19:39,527
You're a very kind and brave boy.

8436
00:19:40,407 --> 00:19:43,927
I'm sure you'll one day become a great man that could repay his master.

8437
00:19:44,927 --> 00:19:46,367
Also you're,

8438
00:19:46,767 --> 00:19:49,527
my important first child.

8439
00:19:54,607 --> 00:19:55,327
Yes.

8440
00:20:00,247 --> 00:20:03,327
Just when we were gone for a little while...

8441
00:20:03,567 --> 00:20:04,907
This is...

8442
00:20:05,927 --> 00:20:08,127
...Sindria Corp. !?

8443
00:20:09,447 --> 00:20:11,487
Just what in the world happened here!?

8444
00:20:16,847 --> 00:20:18,847
Hey, everyone!!

8445
00:20:18,847 --> 00:20:20,607
Sinbad!!?

8446
00:20:21,357 --> 00:20:23,167
See, I told you I'll work it out, didn't I!?

8447
00:20:23,727 --> 00:20:26,097
With this we can now do business in Reim,

8448
00:20:26,447 --> 00:20:29,387
and even trade across the world.

8449
00:20:30,827 --> 00:20:33,127
Sinbad, you worked really hard!

8450
00:20:33,527 --> 00:20:35,947
No, it was all thanks to you Sensei.

8451
00:20:36,247 --> 00:20:37,607
Sensei!!?

8452
00:20:38,067 --> 00:20:39,527
If it weren't for you,

8453
00:20:39,607 --> 00:20:42,167
I wouldn't be here yet alone making it this big.

8454
00:20:42,747 --> 00:20:44,087
No need to thank me.

8455
00:20:44,667 --> 00:20:49,807
As I quite enjoyed your dazzling performances during my stay here.

8456
00:20:50,287 --> 00:20:54,487
I suggest that you publish the performance of your theatre in a book as well.

8457
00:20:56,007 --> 00:20:58,767
I will be heading back to Balbadd now.

8458
00:20:59,527 --> 00:21:01,927
Regretting it may be, but we have to part here.

8459
00:21:02,507 --> 00:21:04,807
If you ever stop by, then head directly to the Palace.

8460
00:21:05,407 --> 00:21:09,527
Needless to say, on the matter of trading with my country that is.

8461
00:21:10,127 --> 00:21:11,847
Yes, Sensei!

8462
00:21:16,167 --> 00:21:18,807
Take care, Sinbad!

8463
00:21:18,947 --> 00:21:21,247
So, what's with Sensei and all!?

8464
00:21:21,427 --> 00:21:23,107
He doesn't seem to be an ordinary guy...!?

8465
00:21:23,687 --> 00:21:28,687
U—m... someone who taught me various things, the King of Balbadd.

8466
00:21:28,707 --> 00:21:30,447
King!!?

8467
00:21:30,567 --> 00:21:32,227
Just what the hell did you do while we're away!?

8468
00:21:32,327 --> 00:21:35,167
Well, let's leave the trivial details for later,

8469
00:21:35,887 --> 00:21:38,407
We can now do business to our heart's content.

8470
00:21:39,407 --> 00:21:41,887
We cannot stay here forever after all...

8471
00:21:42,607 --> 00:21:45,367
In the end, business is something that we need to do in order to get enough funds to form a country.

8472
00:21:46,037 --> 00:21:49,147
Our goal is to create a country after all.

8473
00:21:49,887 --> 00:21:52,967
Good grief... nothing can faze you...

8474
00:21:54,607 --> 00:22:00,207
Soon, as suggested by King Rashid he published his autobiography.

8475
00:22:01,267 --> 00:22:06,087
That was supposed to be a part of advertising for the soon to start business but,

8476
00:22:06,637 --> 00:22:09,427
but soon turned into a pleasurable read among the people all around the world

8477
00:22:09,667 --> 00:22:11,857
as "The Adventures of Sinbad".

8478
00:22:20,387 --> 00:22:23,847
A new start to the Sindria Corp.

8479
00:22:24,447 --> 00:22:26,247
Yeah!!!!!!

8480
00:22:35,497 --> 00:22:38,377
It's because my face was boring

8481
00:22:35,497 --> 00:22:38,377
kagami ni utsuru jibun ga

8482
00:22:38,377 --> 00:22:41,297
that I was reflected in the mirror like that

8483
00:22:38,377 --> 00:22:41,297
saenai kao wo shiteta kara

8484
00:22:41,297 --> 00:22:44,137
The dream I saw of flying in the sky

8485
00:22:41,297 --> 00:22:44,137
kinou mita sora wo tobu yume

8486
00:22:44,137 --> 00:22:46,927
has now started flowing inside my eyes

8487
00:22:44,137 --> 00:22:46,927
hitomi no oku de ugokidasu

8488
00:22:46,927 --> 00:22:49,807
If only I had a bit of courage

8489
00:22:46,927 --> 00:22:49,807
sukoshi no yuuki ga arunara

8490
00:22:49,807 --> 00:22:52,767
I could've flown at anytime

8491
00:22:49,807 --> 00:22:52,767
itsudemo tobidaseru no ni

8492
00:22:52,767 --> 00:22:58,397
A breeze rushed across the shore

8493
00:22:52,767 --> 00:22:58,397
oounabara ni kaze ga fuiteta yo

8494
00:22:58,397 --> 00:23:03,277
If you stretch your hands

8495
00:22:58,397 --> 00:23:03,277
te wo hirogereba

8496
00:23:03,277 --> 00:23:12,707
A new world will connect

8497
00:23:03,277 --> 00:23:12,707
atarashii sekai ga tsunagaru

8498
00:23:15,417 --> 00:23:20,927
Grasp your body and soul together!

8499
00:23:15,417 --> 00:23:20,927
zenshinzenrei subete wo tsukamu yo!

8500
00:23:20,927 --> 00:23:26,847
There is a new born hope in my hands

8501
00:23:20,927 --> 00:23:26,847
boku no tenonaka ni wa umaretate no kibou

8502
00:23:26,847 --> 00:23:32,477
I wonder what you could see

8503
00:23:26,847 --> 00:23:32,477
habataku tsubasa so nosaki ni

8504
00:23:32,477 --> 00:23:38,317
across those wings of yours? Will I ever know?

8505
00:23:32,477 --> 00:23:38,317
nani ga mieru? wakaru darou

8506
00:23:38,317 --> 00:23:43,947
Together with these feelings of mine

8507
00:23:38,317 --> 00:23:43,947
takanaru kimochi tomo ni

8508
00:23:43,947 --> 00:23:52,997
Let's start our journey!

8509
00:23:43,947 --> 00:23:52,997
kono mama ima tabi ni de yo

